msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ClaimCredenceRangeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "ClaimCredence declarative range constraint"
msgstr "ClaimCredence 声明式取值范围约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ClaimCredenceRangeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A validation-only integrity constraint: a StandpointClaim's gmeow:claimCredence is an xsd:decimal in [0.0, 1.0]."
msgstr "仅用于验证的完整性约束：StandpointClaim 的 gmeow:claimCredence 是位于 [0.0, 1.0] 区间内的 xsd:decimal。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/succeedsClaim|rdfs:label"
msgid "succeeds claim"
msgstr "接续声明"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/succeedsClaim|skos:definition"
msgid "Relates a successor claim-bearing entity to its predecessor when the claimed state changes. The predecessor remains valid during its earlier fact-time interval according to the stated standpoint."
msgstr "当所声明状态发生变化时，将后继声明承载实体关联到前驱。根据所述立场，前驱在其较早的事实时间区间内仍有效。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/succeedsClaim|gmeow:howToUse"
msgid "Annotate the relation with accordingTo and validFrom for its effective time; retain separate fact-time intervals on the claims or name usages."
msgstr "以 accordingTo 和 validFrom 标注关系的立场及生效时间；在声明或名称使用上保留独立的事实时间区间。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/succeedsClaim|gmeow:useWhen"
msgid "Relates a successor claim-bearing entity to its predecessor when the claimed state changes. The predecessor remains valid during its earlier fact-time interval according to the stated standpoint."
msgstr "当所声明状态发生变化时，将后继声明承载实体关联到前驱。根据所述立场，前驱在其较早的事实时间区间内仍有效。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/succeedsClaim|gmeow:avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not infer global truth, deletion, a preferred claim or a change in another standpoint."
msgstr "不要推断全局真值、删除、首选声明或另一立场中的变化。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/succeedsClaim|skos:scopeNote"
msgid "The effective time of a lifecycle relation is distinct from the fact-time interval of the proposition. Display suppression is a projection policy, not a global truth judgment."
msgstr "生命周期关系的生效时间与命题的事实时间区间不同。显示抑制是投影政策，而非全局真值判断。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/succeedsClaim|skos:example"
msgid "ex:janet gmeow:succeedsClaim ex:bob ."
msgstr "ex:janet gmeow:succeedsClaim ex:bob ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correctsClaim|rdfs:label"
msgid "corrects claim"
msgstr "纠正声明"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correctsClaim|skos:definition"
msgid "Relates a correcting claim-bearing entity to a predecessor rejected as erroneous by the correcting standpoint, including its purported earlier validity. It does not make the predecessor globally false in other standpoints."
msgstr "将纠正声明承载实体关联到被纠正立场判为错误的前驱，包括其声称的早期有效性。这不会使前驱在其他立场下全局为假。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correctsClaim|gmeow:howToUse"
msgid "Annotate the relation with accordingTo and validFrom for when the correction took effect. Suppress the erroneous predecessor in that standpoint without erasing its retained record."
msgstr "以 accordingTo 和 validFrom 标注纠正的立场及生效时间。在该立场下抑制错误前驱的显示，但不删除其保留记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correctsClaim|gmeow:useWhen"
msgid "Relates a correcting claim-bearing entity to a predecessor rejected as erroneous by the correcting standpoint, including its purported earlier validity. It does not make the predecessor globally false in other standpoints."
msgstr "将纠正声明承载实体关联到被纠正立场判为错误的前驱，包括其声称的早期有效性。这不会使前驱在其他立场下全局为假。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correctsClaim|gmeow:avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not infer global truth, deletion, a preferred claim or a change in another standpoint."
msgstr "不要推断全局真值、删除、首选声明或另一立场中的变化。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correctsClaim|skos:scopeNote"
msgid "The effective time of a lifecycle relation is distinct from the fact-time interval of the proposition. Display suppression is a projection policy, not a global truth judgment."
msgstr "生命周期关系的生效时间与命题的事实时间区间不同。显示抑制是投影政策，而非全局真值判断。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/correctsClaim|skos:example"
msgid "ex:correction gmeow:correctsClaim ex:mistakenName ."
msgstr "ex:correction gmeow:correctsClaim ex:mistakenName ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/retractsClaim|rdfs:label"
msgid "retracts claim"
msgstr "撤回声明"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/retractsClaim|skos:definition"
msgid "Relates a withdrawal activity to the claim-bearing entity it withdraws in a stated standpoint. This relation is the canonical lifecycle encoding; a speech-act force alone performs no withdrawal."
msgstr "将撤回活动关联到其在所述立场下撤回的声明承载实体。此关系是规范的生命周期编码；仅有言语行为力度不执行撤回。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/retractsClaim|gmeow:howToUse"
msgid "Type the subject Activity, name its actor with wasAssociatedWith, and annotate the relation with accordingTo and validFrom. Retraction suppresses retained history for ordinary revision; erasure requires separate authorization."
msgstr "将主语定型为 Activity，以 wasAssociatedWith 指定行为者，并以 accordingTo 和 validFrom 标注关系。普通修订中的撤回抑制历史显示并保留记录；删除需要独立授权。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/retractsClaim|gmeow:useWhen"
msgid "Relates a withdrawal activity to the claim-bearing entity it withdraws in a stated standpoint. This relation is the canonical lifecycle encoding; a speech-act force alone performs no withdrawal."
msgstr "将撤回活动关联到其在所述立场下撤回的声明承载实体。此关系是规范的生命周期编码；仅有言语行为力度不执行撤回。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/retractsClaim|gmeow:avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not infer global truth, deletion, a preferred claim or a change in another standpoint."
msgstr "不要推断全局真值、删除、首选声明或另一立场中的变化。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/retractsClaim|skos:scopeNote"
msgid "The effective time of a lifecycle relation is distinct from the fact-time interval of the proposition. Display suppression is a projection policy, not a global truth judgment."
msgstr "生命周期关系的生效时间与命题的事实时间区间不同。显示抑制是投影政策，而非全局真值判断。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/retractsClaim|skos:example"
msgid "ex:withdrawal a gmeow:Activity ; gmeow:retractsClaim ex:claim ."
msgstr "ex:withdrawal a gmeow:Activity ; gmeow:retractsClaim ex:claim ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ModalForce|gmeow:howToUse"
msgid "Reference a modal-force individual via claimModalForce on a StandpointClaim or standpointModalForce on an annotated statement. An absent modal force is unspecified, not necessary or actual. State gmeow:modalForceNecessary explicitly when necessity is intended."
msgstr "在 StandpointClaim 上通过 claimModalForce，或在带注释语句上通过 standpointModalForce 引用模态力度个体。模态力度缺省表示未指定，而非必然或现实。若意指必然性，应明确给出 gmeow:modalForceNecessary。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/modalForceNecessary|skos:definition"
msgid "The proposition holds in every precisification admitted by the standpoint. This explicit necessary force participates in the seeded unequivocal and refuted decompositions; it is never inferred from absence."
msgstr "命题在该立场允许的每种精确化中成立。此明确的必然力度参与预设的 unequivocal 和 refuted 分解；绝不从缺省推断。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/standpointModalForce|skos:definition"
msgid "The alethic modal force of an annotated proposition, orthogonal to credence and confidence. It is the flattened-statement twin of claimModalForce. An absent modal force is unspecified, not necessary or actual. State gmeow:modalForceNecessary explicitly when necessity is intended."
msgstr "带注释命题的真势模态力度，与信念程度及置信度正交。它是 claimModalForce 的扁平语句对应项。模态力度缺省表示未指定，而非必然或现实。若意指必然性，应明确给出 gmeow:modalForceNecessary。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/claimModalForce|gmeow:howToUse"
msgid "Name one ModalForce individual when specified; flatten it to standpointModalForce without supplying a value for absence. An absent modal force is unspecified, not necessary or actual. State gmeow:modalForceNecessary explicitly when necessity is intended."
msgstr "指定时引用一个 ModalForce 个体；扁平化为 standpointModalForce 时不得为缺省补值。模态力度缺省表示未指定，而非必然或现实。若意指必然性，应明确给出 gmeow:modalForceNecessary。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/claimModalForceFunctionality|skos:definition"
msgid "The canonical functional-property obligation permits at most one explicit claimModalForce per claim. Absence remains unspecified; functionality does not require a value or supply necessary."
msgstr "规范函数属性约束允许每个声明至多一个明确的 claimModalForce。缺省仍为未指定；函数性不要求存在值，也不补入 necessary。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/claimModalForceFunctionality|gmeow:useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject multiple explicit modal-force values without requiring a missing value."
msgstr "用于拒绝多个明确模态力度值，而不要求补齐缺失值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assertoricRetract|skos:definition"
msgid "The retract speech-act force describes an utterance of withdrawal. It does not withdraw its carrying claim or change lifecycle state. Use an Activity with retractsClaim for lifecycle withdrawal; ordinary revision retains suppressed history and governed erasure requires separate authorization."
msgstr "retract 言语行为力度描述撤回话语。它不撤回承载它的声明，也不改变生命周期状态。生命周期撤回应使用带有 retractsClaim 的 Activity；普通修订保留受抑制历史，受治理删除需要独立授权。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AssertoricForce|skos:definition"
msgid "The speech-act force axis: assert puts a proposition forward, conjecture offers it tentatively, assume supposes it for argument, retract describes a withdrawal utterance. Speech-act classification alone has no lifecycle effect."
msgstr "言语行为力度轴：assert 提出命题，conjecture 暂时提出猜想，assume 为论证而假设，retract 描述撤回话语。仅作言语行为分类不影响生命周期。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AssertoricForce|gmeow:avoidWhen"
msgid "The retract speech-act force describes an utterance of withdrawal. It does not withdraw its carrying claim or change lifecycle state. Use an Activity with retractsClaim for lifecycle withdrawal; ordinary revision retains suppressed history and governed erasure requires separate authorization."
msgstr "retract 言语行为力度描述撤回话语。它不撤回承载它的声明，也不改变生命周期状态。生命周期撤回应使用带有 retractsClaim 的 Activity；普通修订保留受抑制历史，受治理删除需要独立授权。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/claimAssertoricForce|gmeow:avoidWhen"
msgid "The retract speech-act force describes an utterance of withdrawal. It does not withdraw its carrying claim or change lifecycle state. Use an Activity with retractsClaim for lifecycle withdrawal; ordinary revision retains suppressed history and governed erasure requires separate authorization."
msgstr "retract 言语行为力度描述撤回话语。它不撤回承载它的声明，也不改变生命周期状态。生命周期撤回应使用带有 retractsClaim 的 Activity；普通修订保留受抑制历史，受治理删除需要独立授权。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/claimAssertoricForceFunctionality|skos:definition"
msgid "The canonical functional-property obligation permits at most one explicit claimAssertoricForce per claim. The retract value classifies speech only; lifecycle withdrawal is represented by Activity/retractsClaim."
msgstr "规范函数属性约束允许每个声明至多一个明确的 claimAssertoricForce。retract 值仅分类言语；生命周期撤回以 Activity/retractsClaim 表示。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StandpointModality|gmeow:howToUse"
msgid "Reference a seeded legacy modality only when explicitly specified. Absence is unspecified and supplies no modal force; only explicit legacy values carry their declared decompositions."
msgstr "仅在明确指定时引用预设旧式模态。缺省为未指定，不补入模态力度；只有明确值才携带其声明的分解。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/claimModality|gmeow:howToUse"
msgid "Reference a seeded legacy modality only when explicitly specified. Absence is unspecified and supplies no modal force; only explicit legacy values carry their declared decompositions."
msgstr "仅在明确指定时引用预设旧式模态。缺省为未指定，不补入模态力度；只有明确值才携带其声明的分解。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/unequivocal|skos:definition"
msgid "Explicit settled or necessary truth according to a standpoint: the proposition holds in every admitted precisification. Its declared decomposition includes necessary. An absent modality never implies this value."
msgstr "某立场下明确的确定或必然真：命题在所有允许的精确化中成立。其声明分解包含 necessary。模态缺省绝不隐含此值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/standpoint|skos:scopeNote"
msgid "Suppression retains superseded records during ordinary revision. Separately authorized governed erasure removes exactly selected named objects, including its forget request, without retained deletion receipts or cascading through references. Unselected references may dangle and answer gone. Succession preserves prior fact-time validity; correction rejects the earlier claim only in the correcting standpoint."
msgstr "普通修订通过显示抑制保留被替代记录。独立授权的受治理删除只移除选定命名对象，包括遗忘请求本身，不保留删除回执，也不沿引用级联删除。未选中引用可以悬空并返回“已不存在”。接续保留早期事实时间有效性；纠正仅在纠正立场下拒绝早先声明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/claimModalityFunctionality|skos:definition"
msgid "The canonical functional-property obligation permits at most one explicit legacy claimModality per claim. Absence is unspecified, supplies no unequivocal value and licenses no necessary-force decomposition."
msgstr "规范函数属性约束允许每个声明至多一个明确的旧式 claimModality。缺省为未指定，不补入 unequivocal 值，也不允许必然力度分解。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/claimModalityFunctionality|gmeow:useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject multiple explicit legacy modality values without requiring a missing value."
msgstr "用于拒绝多个明确的旧式模态值，而不要求补齐缺失值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThan|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "more entrenched than"
msgstr "比……更根深蒂固"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThan|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "S1 is more entrenched than S2: the party who ranks the two frames holds S1 to be the more settled of them. The ranking is a strict partial order that exists only as dated claims attributed to the ranker: every asserted edge needs a reifier annotated with gmeow:accordingTo for the party who ranks and with gmeow:validFrom for the instant from which the ranking holds, and gmeow:moreEntrenchedThanAttributionConstraint rejects an edge without both. Within one ranker the order is irreflexive (gmeow:moreEntrenchedThanIrreflexivity) and asymmetric: gmeow:moreEntrenchedThanRankerOrderConstraint rejects a ranker who holds a pair in both directions at once, unless one of the two claims is succeeded or corrected by the other, or is retracted, through the claim-lifecycle relations. It is transitive within one ranker's live claims: gmeow:moreEntrenchedThanRankerClosureConstraint requires a ranker who holds a claim ranking a over b and a claim ranking b over c to hold a claim ranking a over c as well, where none of the three is succeeded, corrected or retracted. It is not declared transitive or asymmetric globally: a global closure would chain one ranker's claim with another's and entail a ranking that no party made, and two rankers may legitimately rank a pair in opposite directions (Principle 9). Together these checks reject a cycle of any length among one ranker's live claims. They read the record as it stands and compare no dates, so a cycle among the claims selected at an evaluation instant is reported by the consumer and not by a canonical check. A missing claim means the two frames are incomparable — never equal and never lower. It is never derived from gmeow:sharpens: sharpening is containment, and reading the sharper frame as the more entrenched would invert a chain such a ranker made. It is a presentation aid for ordering frames, not a confidence, a truth value, or the epistemic-entrenchment ordering that drives logic:EntrenchmentRevision."
msgstr "S1 比 S2 更根深蒂固：对这两个框架进行排序的一方认为 S1 是二者中更稳固的一个。该排序是严格偏序，仅以归属于排序者的带日期主张形式存在：每条被断言的边都需要一个具体化者（reifier），其上带有 gmeow:accordingTo（指明排序方）和 gmeow:validFrom（指明排序自何时起成立），而 gmeow:moreEntrenchedThanAttributionConstraint 会拒绝缺少二者之一的边。在同一排序者之内，该序是非自反且反对称的：gmeow:moreEntrenchedThanRankerOrderConstraint 会拒绝同时在两个方向上持有同一对框架的排序者，除非这两条主张中的一条已被另一条通过主张生命周期关系取代或更正，或已被撤回。它在单个排序者的有效主张之内是传递的：gmeow:moreEntrenchedThanRankerClosureConstraint 要求，持有把 a 排在 b 之上的主张和把 b 排在 c 之上的主张的排序者，也须持有把 a 排在 c 之上的主张，且三者均未被取代、更正或撤回。它并未被声明为全局传递或全局反对称：全局闭包会把一个排序者的主张与另一个排序者的主张串联，从而蕴含出无人作出过的排序，而且两个排序者可以合理地对同一对框架作出相反排序（原则 9）。这些检查合起来会拒绝同一排序者有效主张中任意长度的环。它们按记录的现状读取，不比较任何日期，因此在某一评估时刻选出的主张之间的环由使用方报告，而不由规范检查报告。缺失主张表示两个框架不可比较——绝不意味着相等，也绝不意味着更低。它绝不由 gmeow:sharpens 推导：锐化是包含关系，把更锐化的框架读作更根深蒂固，会颠倒此类排序者所作的链。它是用于排列框架的呈现辅助，不是置信度，不是真值，也不是驱动 logic:EntrenchmentRevision 的认知根深度排序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThan|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:communityView gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan ex:fringeView {| gmeow:accordingTo ex:editorialBoard ; gmeow:validFrom \"2026-03-01T00:00:00Z\"^^xsd:dateTime |} ."
msgstr "ex:communityView gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan ex:fringeView {| gmeow:accordingTo ex:editorialBoard ; gmeow:validFrom \"2026-03-01T00:00:00Z\"^^xsd:dateTime |} ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThan|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid asserting it without the ranker and the date on the statement, which is rejected, avoid reading a missing claim as equal or lower, avoid deriving it from gmeow:sharpens, and avoid using it as a confidence, a truth value, or a belief-revision ordering. Avoid reading the top of a ranker's order as the primary or preferred frame (Principle 9). Never close it across rankers: chain only the claims one party made. Avoid ending a ranking by rewriting it or by an invented end instant: record a change or withdrawal with the claim-lifecycle relations."
msgstr "避免在陈述上缺少排序者和日期时断言它（这样的陈述会被拒绝）；避免把缺失主张读作相等或更低；避免从 gmeow:sharpens 推导它；避免将其用作置信度、真值或信念修正排序。避免把排序者的排序顶端读作主要或首选框架（原则 9）。绝不跨排序者闭合：只串联同一方作出的主张。避免通过改写排序或杜撰的结束时刻来终止一项排序：应使用主张生命周期关系记录变更或撤回。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThan|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Assert it from the more entrenched standpoint to the less entrenched one as an annotated statement, naming the party who ranks with gmeow:accordingTo and the instant from which the ranking holds with gmeow:validFrom; an edge without both is rejected. Leave a pair with no claim unranked. When one ranker's live claims rank a over b and b over c, also record that ranker's dated claim ranking a over c; a chain without it is rejected. To change or withdraw a ranking, keep the earlier claim and record the change with the claim-lifecycle relations, naming the reifier of the ranking statement: gmeow:succeedsClaim for a reversal or replacement, gmeow:correctsClaim for a ranking made in error, gmeow:retractsClaim for a withdrawal. To order frames for display at an evaluation instant t, take one ranker's claims whose gmeow:validFrom is not later than t, leave out a claim suppressed with gmeow:displayable false, a corrected claim, a claim whose retraction or successor has taken effect by t, close what remains transitively on its own, and treat any pair left unordered as incomparable; if the remaining claims still contain a cycle, report it and do not pick a side. A historical order at t answers what the ranker held at t. It ignores gmeow:displayable, which is a display policy and not a truth judgment. It keeps a superseded claim for every t before its successor took effect and leaves it out from that instant on. It leaves out a corrected claim at every t, because a correction rejects the earlier validity of the claim. It keeps a retracted claim for every t before its retraction took effect and leaves it out from that instant on, because a retraction withdraws endorsement from then on and does not erase that the claim was made. A lifecycle relation takes effect at the earliest gmeow:validFrom on its own statement; one that carries no such date counts as in effect at every t. The canonical checks read the record as it stands and not at an instant, so the consumer still closes the claims selected at t, per ranker."
msgstr "以带注解陈述的形式，从更根深蒂固的立场指向较不根深蒂固的立场来断言它，用 gmeow:accordingTo 指明排序方，用 gmeow:validFrom 指明排序自何时起成立；缺少二者之一的边会被拒绝。没有主张的框架对保持未排序。当同一排序者的有效主张把 a 排在 b 之上、把 b 排在 c 之上时，还须记录该排序者把 a 排在 c 之上的带日期主张；缺少它的链会被拒绝。要变更或撤回某项排序，请保留先前的主张，并使用主张生命周期关系记录变更，且须指明排序陈述的具体化者：用 gmeow:succeedsClaim 表示反转或替换，用 gmeow:correctsClaim 表示错误作出的排序，用 gmeow:retractsClaim 表示撤回。要在评估时刻 t 为展示而排列框架，取单个排序者 gmeow:validFrom 不晚于 t 的主张，排除以 gmeow:displayable false 隐藏的主张、已被更正的主张，以及其撤回或后继在 t 之前已生效的主张，对其余主张单独做传递闭包，并将仍无顺序的框架对视为不可比较；若其余主张仍含环，请报告该环，不要择边而取。t 时刻的历史排序回答排序者在 t 时持有什么。它忽略 gmeow:displayable，那是展示策略而非真值判断。对于后继生效之前的每个 t，它保留被取代的主张，自该时刻起将其排除。它在每个 t 都排除已被更正的主张，因为更正否定了该主张先前的有效性。对于撤回生效之前的每个 t，它保留被撤回的主张，自该时刻起将其排除，因为撤回是自那时起收回认可，并不抹去该主张曾被作出这一事实。生命周期关系在其自身陈述所带最早的 gmeow:validFrom 时刻生效；不带该日期的关系视为在每个 t 都已生效。规范检查按记录的现状读取，而不针对某一时刻，因此使用方仍须按排序者对在 t 选出的主张做闭包。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThan|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to record that a named party ranks one standpoint as more entrenched than another, when the ranking is only partly known and a pair nobody ranked must stay incomparable."
msgstr "当某一指名方将一个立场排序为比另一个更根深蒂固、排序仅部分已知、且无人排序的框架对必须保持不可比较时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanIrreflexivity|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "moreEntrenchedThan is irreflexive"
msgstr "「比……更根深蒂固」是非自反的"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanIrreflexivity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan is irreflexive: no party ranks a standpoint as more entrenched than itself, as its skos:definition states. The native coherence gate reads this to raise a violation for a standpoint ranked above itself. Transitivity and asymmetry are deliberately not declared, because both would reach across rankers."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan 是非自反的：如其 skos:definition 所述，任何一方都不会把某个立场排序为比自身更根深蒂固。原生一致性门读取此项，为排在自身之上的立场抛出一个违规。传递性和反对称性被刻意不声明，因为两者都会跨越排序者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanIrreflexivity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan never relates a standpoint to itself; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan 绝不将某立场关联到自身时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanIrreflexivity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a self-edge is meaningful — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当自环有意义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanIrreflexivity|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan, logic:characteristicSort logic:irreflexiveProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan, logic:characteristicSort logic:irreflexiveProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanIrreflexivity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanIrreflexivity|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:moreEntrenchedThanIrreflexivity logic:characterizes gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan ."
msgstr "gmeow:moreEntrenchedThanIrreflexivity logic:characterizes gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanAttributionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "More entrenched than attribution constraint"
msgstr "更根深蒂固于的归属约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanAttributionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: every gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan edge asserted from a gmeow:Standpoint must have an RDF 1.2 reifier of the same statement that carries both a gmeow:accordingTo value naming the party who ranks and a gmeow:validFrom value giving the instant from which the ranking holds, so that the order exists only as dated claims attributed to a ranker. A bare edge, or an edge whose reifier lacks either annotation, is rejected. It checks that the annotations are present, not who the ranker is or whether the date is sensible. A universal-to-existential formula over the lowered reifier components."
msgstr "一项封闭世界完整性约束：从 gmeow:Standpoint 断言的每条 gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan 边，都必须有同一陈述的一个 RDF 1.2 具体化者，其上同时带有指明排序方的 gmeow:accordingTo 值和给出排序自何时起成立的 gmeow:validFrom 值，使该序仅以归属于排序者的带日期主张形式存在。裸边，或其具体化者缺少任一注解的边，都会被拒绝。它只检查注解是否存在，不检查排序者是谁，也不检查日期是否合理。这是一个针对已降低的具体化者分量的全称到存在公式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanAttributionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid reading it as proof that the ranker is the right party, that the date is correct, or that the ranking is still current: it checks presence only, and it applies to an edge whose subject is typed gmeow:Standpoint."
msgstr "避免把它读作排序者是正确一方、日期正确或排序仍然有效的证明：它只检查存在性，并且只适用于主语被类型化为 gmeow:Standpoint 的边。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanAttributionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Annotate every gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan statement with gmeow:accordingTo and gmeow:validFrom on its reifier; the constraint needs no other input."
msgstr "在每条 gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan 陈述的具体化者上标注 gmeow:accordingTo 和 gmeow:validFrom；该约束不需要其他输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanAttributionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to confirm that every ranking between standpoints is a dated claim attributed to the party who ranks."
msgstr "用于确认立场之间的每项排序都是归属于排序方的带日期主张。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanRankerOrderConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "More entrenched than per-ranker order constraint"
msgstr "更根深蒂固于的按排序者序约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanRankerOrderConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: one ranker may not hold both gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan(a, b) and gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan(b, a) as live claims, the reversed pair that would make the strict order symmetric. Both edges are matched through their RDF 1.2 reifiers, which must name the same ranker with gmeow:accordingTo, so two different rankers ranking a pair in opposite directions is the legal co-equal conflict of Principle 9 and is never rejected. A pair is exempt when one claim is linked to the other by gmeow:succeedsClaim or gmeow:correctsClaim in either direction, or when either claim is the object of a gmeow:retractsClaim, because those relations are the repository's encoding of a ranker changing or withdrawing a ranking. An edge from a standpoint to itself is the degenerate reversed pair. Only the pair of two claims is checked here: gmeow:moreEntrenchedThanRankerClosureConstraint requires the claim that spans a longer chain of live claims, and that claim meets the claim closing a longer cycle as a reversed pair."
msgstr "一项封闭世界完整性约束：同一排序者不得同时把 gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan(a, b) 和 gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan(b, a) 作为有效主张持有，这种反向配对会使严格序变为对称。两条边通过各自的 RDF 1.2 具体化者匹配，且这些具体化者必须用 gmeow:accordingTo 指明同一排序者，因此两个不同排序者对同一对框架作出相反排序，属于原则 9 所述合法的平权冲突，绝不会被拒绝。当一条主张与另一条主张在任一方向上由 gmeow:succeedsClaim 或 gmeow:correctsClaim 相连，或任一主张是某个 gmeow:retractsClaim 的对象时，该配对被豁免，因为这些关系是本仓库对排序者变更或撤回排序的编码。从某立场指向其自身的边是反向配对的退化情形。此处只检查两条主张构成的配对：gmeow:moreEntrenchedThanRankerClosureConstraint 要求存在跨越更长有效主张链的主张，而该主张与闭合更长环的主张构成反向配对。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanRankerOrderConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid reading it as a check across rankers, who may legitimately disagree, as a check of a cycle longer than two, or as a check of who made a lifecycle link: any claim-lifecycle link between the two claims exempts the pair."
msgstr "避免把它读作跨排序者的检查（排序者之间可以合理地意见不一）、长度超过二的环的检查，或生命周期关系由谁作出的检查：两条主张之间任何主张生命周期关系都会使该配对获得豁免。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanRankerOrderConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Record a reversal as a new ranking statement that gmeow:succeedsClaim the earlier one, a mistaken ranking with gmeow:correctsClaim, and a withdrawal with a gmeow:Activity that gmeow:retractsClaim the earlier claim; name the reifier of each ranking statement so that the lifecycle relation can reach it."
msgstr "把反转记录为一条 gmeow:succeedsClaim 前一条的新排序陈述，把错误的排序用 gmeow:correctsClaim 记录，把撤回记录为一个 gmeow:retractsClaim 先前主张的 gmeow:Activity；请为每条排序陈述的具体化者命名，以便生命周期关系能够指向它。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanRankerOrderConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject a ranker who ranks the same two frames in both directions at once without recording a succession, correction or withdrawal."
msgstr "用于拒绝这样的排序者：同时在两个方向上对同一对框架排序，却没有记录取代、更正或撤回。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanRankerClosureConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "More entrenched than per-ranker closure constraint"
msgstr "更根深蒂固于的按排序者闭包约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanRankerClosureConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: when one ranker holds a live claim gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan(a, b) and a live claim gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan(b, c), that ranker must also hold a live claim gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan(a, c), so that each ranker's live claims are closed under transitivity. All three edges are matched through their RDF 1.2 reifiers, which must name the same ranker with gmeow:accordingTo, so the claims of different rankers are never chained (Principle 9). A claim is live when it is the object of no gmeow:succeedsClaim, no gmeow:correctsClaim and no gmeow:retractsClaim. A premise that is superseded, corrected or retracted does not oblige, and the concluding claim must itself be live: the live claims are the ones a displayed order keeps once every recorded lifecycle relation has taken effect, so they then already contain every ranking that closing them derives. Together with gmeow:moreEntrenchedThanIrreflexivity and gmeow:moreEntrenchedThanRankerOrderConstraint this rejects a cycle of any length among one ranker's live claims: the closure forces a live claim from the first standpoint of the cycle to its last, and that claim meets the claim closing the cycle as a reversed pair. The check reads the record as it stands and compares no dates, so it does not judge the order at an evaluation instant. logic:transitiveReach is not used, because it follows one fixed property over asserted edges and cannot be restricted to the reifiers that name one ranker. A universal-to-existential formula over the lowered reifier components."
msgstr "一项封闭世界完整性约束：当同一排序者持有有效主张 gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan(a, b) 和有效主张 gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan(b, c) 时，该排序者还必须持有有效主张 gmeow:moreEntrenchedThan(a, c)，使每位排序者的有效主张在传递性下封闭。三条边都通过各自的 RDF 1.2 具体化者匹配，且这些具体化者必须用 gmeow:accordingTo 指明同一排序者，因此不同排序者的主张绝不会被串联（原则 9）。一条主张不是任何 gmeow:succeedsClaim、gmeow:correctsClaim 或 gmeow:retractsClaim 的对象时，即为有效。已被取代、更正或撤回的前提不产生义务，而结论主张本身必须有效：有效主张正是所有已记录的生命周期关系生效之后展示排序所保留的主张，因此它们届时已包含对其做闭包所能推导出的每项排序。它与 gmeow:moreEntrenchedThanIrreflexivity 和 gmeow:moreEntrenchedThanRankerOrderConstraint 一起，拒绝同一排序者有效主张中任意长度的环：闭包强制要求存在一条从环的第一个立场指向最后一个立场的有效主张，而该主张与闭合该环的主张构成反向配对。该检查按记录的现状读取，不比较任何日期，因此不评判某一评估时刻的排序。此处不使用 logic:transitiveReach，因为它沿着一个固定属性在已断言的边上追踪，无法限定于指明同一排序者的具体化者。这是一个针对已降低的具体化者分量的全称到存在公式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanRankerClosureConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid reading it as a closure across rankers, as a derivation that adds the missing claim for you, as a check of the order at an evaluation instant, or as a check of who made a lifecycle link: any claim-lifecycle link to a claim makes that claim not live. It applies to a chain whose first standpoint is typed gmeow:Standpoint."
msgstr "避免把它读作跨排序者的闭包、替你补上缺失主张的推导、某一评估时刻的排序检查，或生命周期关系由谁作出的检查：任何指向某条主张的主张生命周期关系都会使该主张不再有效。它适用于第一个立场被类型化为 gmeow:Standpoint 的链。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanRankerClosureConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "When a ranker ranks a over b and b over c, record that ranker's dated claim ranking a over c as its own annotated statement. When a premise is succeeded, corrected or retracted the obligation lapses, and the concluding claim can then be changed or withdrawn with the same claim-lifecycle relations."
msgstr "当排序者把 a 排在 b 之上、把 b 排在 c 之上时，请把该排序者将 a 排在 c 之上的带日期主张记录为一条独立的带注解陈述。当某个前提被取代、更正或撤回时，该义务即告消失，结论主张随后可用同样的主张生命周期关系变更或撤回。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/moreEntrenchedThanRankerClosureConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to reject a ranker whose live claims rank a over b and b over c without a live claim that ranks a over c."
msgstr "用于拒绝这样的排序者：其有效主张把 a 排在 b 之上、把 b 排在 c 之上，却没有把 a 排在 c 之上的有效主张。"
